;Description
:This template is used to link to a Tiktok profile.
;Syntax
:Place <code><nowiki>{{Tiktok|<username>|description*}}</nowiki></code> and substitute <username> with the latter part of the Utaite's Tiktok Profile link. If necessary, use the article's talk page to discuss further details.

;Example<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:<pre>{{Tiktok|ameno_kosame|Kosame's Tiktok description}}</pre>

;Will result in<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:{{Tiktok|ameno_kosame|Kosame's 
Tiktok description}}

;note<nowiki>:</nowiki>
:description field is optional.

